{"id":"en_oops-i-m-surrounded-by-wealth","title":"Oops, I’m Surrounded by Wealth","titleEn":"Oops, I’m Surrounded by Wealth","description":"Jiang Chen, a food delivery worker, sees his life unravel when his girlfriend betrays him and his career stalls. Everything changes when he inherits the fortune of an elderly man he cared for over three years, a billionaire who leaves him the entire estate on one condition: Jiang Chen must spend three billion within three months. Accepting the challenge, he sets about finding ways to spend the money, and along the way humiliates his ex-girlfriend and a male rival. During a hotel rest, he comes across a livestream by his childhood friend Yang Xue, who works at an orphanage. Their reunion is interrupted by troublemakers, and the two part on poor terms. Later, an old debt tied to the male antagonist leads to Jiang Chen's capture by a gang leader. The lawyer he counted on never arrives, and on","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/oops-im-surrounded-by-wealth/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/oops-im-surrounded-by-wealth/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Avenge","Billionaire","Business War","Karma","Love","Pretending to be weak to deceive others"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds30i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_oops-i-m-surrounded-by-wealth_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds30i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_oops-i-m-surrounded-by-wealth_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds30i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_oops-i-m-surrounded-by-wealth_3","title":"Episode 3","seas